=== B2: the b = a+1 counterexample family, symbolic in a ===
All queries: `a` is an UNBOUNDED Sort::Int variable. Nothing sampled.

(i) THE IDENTITY  a(x-y) = b z  with (x,y,z) = (a b^2+1, 1, a^2 b)
