      via | int-real-relax: decided unsat
  TRUE  (i') refute: general b, a(x-y) != b*z                    unsat                         0.00s  want=unsat      OK
      via | int-real-relax: decided unsat
  FALSE ctrl(i): refute: a(x-y) != b*(z+1)  [claim is FALSE]     sat                           0.01s  want=sat        OK
      via | nia-linearize: decided sat
      wit | a=2

